WEBVTT

NOTE
Timed for the Playwright recorder at moderate pacing.
Re-timestamp after re-recording (`npm run record:demo`) if steps drift.

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.800
Overview: we'll list supply from a photo, post a complementary need,

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:08.800
then open Matches and save a first workflow action.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.800
Navigate to Bulk Import Resources—the page where photo import lives.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.800
Choose a JPEG, PNG, or WebP shelf or inventory-style photo,

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:26.800
then run Preview From Photo to extract a drafted resource listing.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:33.600
Review the draft title, visibility, and quantity before saving.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.200
Commit Import publishes the resource to your catalog.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:47.600
Post a matching need—for example shelters ordering the same SKU class.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:55.600
Creating the need enters it into matching so pairs can surface.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:01:04.600
Open Matches: knapsack shows the suggested pairing with rationale and score.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:12.600
Kick off coordination: Clarify queues optional notes,

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:19.600
Save action transitions the pair to in-conversation—you can use the thread next.
